@title Ctrl+K "fingered ducts" finds the Slotted ducts switch and turns it off and on in the 3D view
@area Palette
# C-23: the command answers to slotted, fingered, finger and trunking; run from the palette it opens the 3D view and flips Layers > Slotted ducts.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text fingered ducts
wait 6
expect "slotted"
shot palette-fingered-ducts
check_layout
key Enter
wait 40
shot ducts-solid
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text slotted ducts
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot ducts-slotted
check_layout
